     1778   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1779        b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 4
     1780        BUTTON-1 AT ROW 2.5 COL 2 WIDGET-ID 14
     1781        Btn_OK AT ROW 1 COL 11 WIDGET-ID 10
